# .active-contributor.example  —  template; copy to `.active-contributor` (drop the .example).
#
# Identifies the human on whose behalf an agent is contributing code. Consumed by AGENTS-licensing.md.
# Lines starting with `#` are comments. Provide exactly ONE non-comment line:
#
#     Full Name <optional-email>
#
# Required for in-scope (actual code) edits. If `.active-contributor` is absent when a code edit is
# needed, agents MUST error (E-NOCONTRIB) and halt until it is created. Not used for docs/specs.

Your Name <you@example.com>
